'''BUSTERFEST''' (バスターズ祭, ''Basutāzu-sai'', ''' Busters Festival''') is one of the Rare Cat Capsule events in [[The Battle Cats]] added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]]. The event features all of the [[:Category:Busters Events|Buster]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]] and all of the other Ubers in their respective sets.

==Chances==
{{GachaChances
|UberChance = 7%
|SuperChance = 25%
|RareChance = 68%
}}

