All of the banners as well as original Japanese poster for this event use an early design of [[Goddess of Light Sirius (Uber Rare Cat)|Goddess of Light Sirius]], in which she had a somewhat different ponytail alongside a loincloth in place of the plate hanging from her breastplate.

